# Line endings are load-bearing here, not cosmetic.
#
# cmd.exe mis-parses LF-only batch files: goto/label matching, parenthesised
# blocks and for loops fail, usually silently rather than with an error. Bash
# does the opposite -- a CRLF shebang script dies with "bad interpreter".
# So each file type is pinned to the ending its interpreter needs, and git is
# told never to "helpfully" convert them on checkout.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary so no conversion is ever attempted.
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.onnx binary
*.tar.gz binary
